    "raw_text": "SPECIAL CRIME INVESTIGATION WING — ACCUSED INTERROGATION TRANSCRIPT\nSubject: Vikram Malhotra\nDesignation: Chief Systems Architect, Apex Global Securities\nDate of Interrogation: October 22, 2026 at 04:00 PM\nInterrogating Officer: ACP Neha Kashyap\nLocation: Interrogation Room 3, Crime Branch, Chanakyapuri\n\nTRANSCRIPT:\nQ: ACP Neha Kashyap: Where were you on the night of October 21, 2026 between 09:00 PM and midnight?\nA: Vikram Malhotra: I was completely detached from any work or bank operations. I had dinner with my associate Priya Desai at Hotel Oberoi on Dr. Zakir Hussain Marg in New Delhi. I arrived at the restaurant around 09:00 PM and stayed having drinks and discussing private equity investments until approximately 11:45 PM.\n\nQ: ACP Kashyap: Did you visit Connaught Bank or Barakhamba Road at any point that night?\nA: Vikram Malhotra: Absolutely not. I never stepped foot near Barakhamba Road or Connaught Bank that entire night. My car, a dark car, was left with the hotel valet parking throughout the entire duration.\n\nQ: ACP Kashyap: What time did you reach your residence in Vasant Kunj?\nA: Vikram Malhotra: I drove directly home from Hotel Oberoi. I reached my home in Vasant Kunj at approximately 12:15 AM and remained there until police arrived the following morning.\n",
